====================================================================================
HOW TO READ THIS
====================================================================================
  FP corrected negative and FN corrected positive
      -> the descriptor branch pushes each molecule the right way. It is
         causing the corrections, not merely correlated with them.
  Both near zero
      -> the descriptor branch contributes little; the gain comes from
         elsewhere and no attribution method will show otherwise.
  'broke it' rows large in the wrong direction
      -> the branch is confident and wrong there, which is a finding in
         itself and belongs in the paper alongside the corrections.
